# XIV Security

- `L4_AUTONOMY_ENABLED=false`. Agents propose; humans approve consequential actions.
- Never weaken Guardian, RLS, Universe isolation, or approval gates for convenience.
- No secrets in source, commits, logs, or PR bodies. Env keys live in `.env` / `.env.example` names only.
- Never: force push, auto-push `main`, deploy production, mutate production DBs, expand permissions.
- Agents are non-principals. Policy re-check after human approval.
- Do not claim online or production activity while offline.
